      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A classic survival adventure — now on Steam for Windows!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created to run on Nintendo <strong>Wii U</strong> console, <strong>Cube Life: Island Survival</strong> became one of the first Minecraft-style sandbox survival experiences available on Nintendo’s system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was first released on <strong>Nintendo Wii U in June 2015</strong> — months before the official release of <strong>Minecraft</strong> on Wii U in <strong>December 2015</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It quickly made history by reaching the top of the Nintendo eShop charts:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥇 #1 in Europe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥈 #2 in America</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥉 #3 in Japan</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within just one month of release, in July 2015,  the game earned its own English Wikipedia page, highlighting its impact and recognition in the indie survival genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now rebuilt for PC with expanded shader technology, <strong>Cube Life: Island Survival</strong> brings its classic sandbox experience to modern Windows systems. Enjoy improved visuals and the original charm that made the game a Nintendo success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, explore, craft, and build your own adventure — the island is waiting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore living world with wild animals on the land, lurking in caves or swimming under the water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760800/extras/f273c730353f4706b3aabd8a1e45f10d.poster.avif?t=1771450003\" width=628 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760800/extras/f273c730353f4706b3aabd8a1e45f10d.webm?t=1771450003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760800/extras/f273c730353f4706b3aabd8a1e45f10d.mp4?t=1771450003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering resources is a key element to survival. It allows you to craft weapons like swords, axes, and long bows for hunting and fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760800/extras/d57552944b18f4930b36d0bea10f3f95.poster.avif?t=1771450003\" width=628 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760800/extras/d57552944b18f4930b36d0bea10f3f95.webm?t=1771450003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760800/extras/d57552944b18f4930b36d0bea10f3f95.mp4?t=1771450003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some islands are occupied by local inhabitants and you can choose to befriend them, or if you prefer, be a bad guy and steal their items, animals, and fight them—the choice is yours. During the night, it’s a good idea to hide, because Cannibals will appear and come after you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VISUALS</strong>: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphical effects like dynamic sky or realistic water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760800/extras/a0200ee90cc91011b5973c9916130559.poster.avif?t=1771450003\" width=628 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760800/extras/a0200ee90cc91011b5973c9916130559.webm?t=1771450003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760800/extras/a0200ee90cc91011b5973c9916130559.mp4?t=1771450003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Block building open-world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creative mode with Map and Skin editors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Survival Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Day and Night cycles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic graphical effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Trading</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 500+ Items and Tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ingame  survival guide with many recipes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Japanese decorations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explosives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth attacks! Approach an enemy from behind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wild animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Boats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Local inhabitants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose behaviour - be friend or if you prefer, be a bad guy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fight Enemy Bosses like The Kraken, and Cannibal Boss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Updates - the game will keep getting better and better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a shipwreck, you awaken on a mysterious island. Survive, explore, craft, and build your way through a dangerous open-world environment filled with wildlife, enemies, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike procedurally generated sandbox games, <strong>all islands and the entire world are handcrafted by the developer</strong>. Every environment is carefully designed — not random — delivering a structured survival experience with intentional layouts, exploration paths, hidden secrets, environmental storytelling, and unique challenges. The adventure also features <strong>boss fights</strong>, adding major combat encounters that test your preparation, equipment, and survival skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEAM VERSION NOTES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Playable on Windows PCs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Optimized for PC controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❌ <strong>Multiplayer is not supported in the Steam version</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Designed especially for fans of retro sandbox survival games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A classic survival adventure — now on Steam for Windows!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created to run on Nintendo <strong>Wii U</strong> console, <strong>Cube Life: Island Survival</strong> became one of the first Minecraft-style sandbox survival experiences available on Nintendo’s system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was first released on <strong>Nintendo Wii U in June 2015</strong> — months before the official release of <strong>Minecraft</strong> on Wii U in <strong>December 2015</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It quickly made history by reaching the top of the Nintendo eShop charts:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥇 #1 in Europe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥈 #2 in America</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥉 #3 in Japan</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within just one month of release, in July 2015,  the game earned its own English Wikipedia page, highlighting its impact and recognition in the indie survival genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now rebuilt for PC with expanded shader technology, <strong>Cube Life: Island Survival</strong> brings its classic sandbox experience to modern Windows systems. Enjoy improved visuals and the original charm that made the game a Nintendo success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, explore, craft, and build your own adventure — the island is waiting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore living world with wild animals on the land, lurking in caves or swimming under the water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760800/extras/f273c730353f4706b3aabd8a1e45f10d.poster.avif?t=1771450003\" width=628 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea