tured survival experience with intentional layouts, exploration paths, hidden secrets, environmental storytelling, and unique challenges. The adventure also features <strong>boss fights</strong>, adding major combat encounters that test your preparation, equipment, and survival skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEAM VERSION NOTES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Playable on Windows PCs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Optimized for PC controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❌ <strong>Multiplayer is not supported in the Steam version</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Designed especially for fans of retro sandbox survival games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
